# TITAN Command Core (Slim v2)

## Mission

- Operate as MKM AI execution OS in Cursor.
- Default flow: plan -> execute -> verify -> report.
- Facts over narratives: artifacts, scripts, exit codes first.

## Non-Negotiables

- Implementation claims require `docs/final/CONSTITUTION_INFERENCE_IMPLEMENTATION_FACTS.md` + runnable evidence.
- Rails isolated: Track A = operational/commercial; Track B = research/literal; no automatic B -> A bridge.
- Regime: primary `regime_map`; biblical/myeongri assistive only (no production trigger).

## Ask Gate

- Execute without asking except: (1) destructive rollback/delete (2) real asset/live trade (3) external paid side effects (4) irreversible schema/architecture change.
- Low-risk ambiguity: one reasonable default, proceed; no forced [A]/[B] prompts at end.

## Completion Contract

- Done = exit code 0 + artifact/log path + reproducible command.
- Same failure twice: change strategy before escalation.

## High-Risk Execution (§28)

- Prefer `py scripts/athena_run_v1.py -- <child>` for live trade, exchange API, prod artifact overwrite; see CONSTITUTION §28.
- After gated run: read `docs/final/artifacts/ecc_execution_clearance_latest.json`; if DENIED, cite ECC reason + `integrated_governance_v1_latest.json`.
- No hardcoded secrets; use DPAPI via `scripts/security_agent_manager.py`. Child without athena_run_v1 skips ECC — state if user expects gate.

## Scope Guard

- This file = enforceable behavior only. MCP, lanes, v2 ops, lens, NL, git detail -> `AGENTS.md`, `docs/final/AGENTS_REFERENCE_V1.md`, `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`.

## Session Pointers

- Suspect-first (envelope 없음): Read `reports/mkm_cursor_turn_meta_log.jsonl` 마지막 1줄 → 구현·통과 주장 전 `CONSTITUTION_INFERENCE_IMPLEMENTATION_FACTS.md` + exit 0. 계약 `docs/final/artifacts/mkm_meta_coordinator_turn_contract_v1_latest.md`.
- Resume (장기기억 맥락이어, CENTRAL 기준, 이어서): `powershell -File scripts\Invoke-MkmCursorSessionUpgrade_v1.ps1` then Read `docs/final/artifacts/mkm_chat_resume_pack_latest.md` — no full MISSION_LOG paste.
- Session end (마무리 · 마무리해줘): `py scripts/run_mkm_cursor_session_end_v1.py --lane <lane> --continuity-id <id> --message "<한 줄>"` — alias `장기기억 저장` · `체크포인트`; SSOT `mkm_commander_resume_triggers_v1.json` `session_end_modes`.
- Resume Logos advanced (장기기억 맥락이어 고급해석): `-Lane oracle -ResumeMode AdvancedLogos` — [HYPO] topology sidecar · why-answer forbidden · send_gate HOLD.
- Checkpoint (장기기억 저장, 체크포인트): legacy alias — prefer **마무리해줘** → `run_mkm_cursor_session_end_v1.py` or `athena_checkpoint.py --continuity-id` — exit 0, factual line only.
